# The Fable Club site: environment variables. Copy to .env.local.
# Both values are PUBLIC by design (they ship to the browser; row level security protects the data).
# Supabase -> Project Settings -> API Keys. Never put the secret key, the deploy hook or DATABASE_URL here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
